{"strongs": "H6549", "word": "נְכוֺ", "translit": "par.oh ne.khoh", "root": "נכו", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Necho", "definition": "נְכוֺ , נְכֹה proper name, masculine Necho (II), king of Egypt (Egyptian Nkw , i.e ( Steind BAS i. 346 f. ) Nekawœ ; Assyrian Nikû Id. ib. Schr COT 2Kgs 23:29 is grandfather of Bibl. Necho); — contemporary of Josiah and Nebuchadnezzar [ B.C. 611-605]: נְכוֺ 2Chr 35:20 ( ᵐ5 θαραω Νεχαω ), נְכֹה 2Chr 35:22 ; 2Chr 36:4 ( ᵐ5 θαραω Νεχαω ); פַּרְעֹה נְכוֺ Jer 46:2 , פַּרְעֹה נְכֹה 2Kgs 23:29 ; 2Kgs 23:33 ; 2Kgs 23:34 ; 2Kgs 23:35 (all ᵐ5 id. ). נָכוֺן proper name, masculine see below כּון , and see כִּידֹן .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5197')\">BDB5197</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5224')\">H5224</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6549')\">H6549</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5196')\">BDB5196</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5198')\">BDB5198</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נְכוֺ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נְכֹה</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>Necho</highlightword> (II), king of Egypt (Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Nkw</highlight></transliteration>, i.e (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Steind')\">Steind<sup>BAS i. 346 f.</sup></lookup>) <transliteration><highlight>Nekawœ</highlight></transliteration>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>Nikû</highlight></transliteration> Id.<sup>ib.</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Schr')\">Schr<sup>COT <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,29)\">2Kgs 23:29</ref></sup></lookup> is grandfather of Bibl. Necho); — contemporary of Josiah and Nebuchadnezzar [ B.C. 611-605]: <bdbheb>נְכוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,20)\">2Chr 35:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>θαραω</grk> <grk>Νεχαω</grk>), <bdbheb>נְכֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,22)\">2Chr 35:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,4)\">2Chr 36:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>θαραω</grk> <grk>Νεχαω</grk>); <bdbheb>פַּרְעֹה נְכוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,2)\">Jer 46:2</ref>, <bdbheb>פַּרְעֹה נְכֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,29)\">2Kgs 23:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,33)\">2Kgs 23:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:34\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,34)\">2Kgs 23:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,35)\">2Kgs 23:35</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>id.</highlight>). </p><hr><p><bdbheb>נָכוֺן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> see below <bdbheb>כּון</bdbheb>, and see <bdbheb>כִּידֹן</bdbheb>.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 23:29", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:20", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:22", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Chr 36:4", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 36, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Jer 46:2", "book": "JER", "chapter": 46, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "2Kgs 23:33", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "2Kgs 23:34", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Kgs 23:35", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 23, "verse": 35}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["נְכוֺ", "נְכֹה", "ᵐ5", "פַּרְעֹה נְכוֺ", "פַּרְעֹה נְכֹה", "נָכוֺן", "